{25}{[His eyes narrow in displeasure.] You're treading on thin ice stranger. But for the last time, I'll concede to answer you. No, I did not open the portal. I found out about it, and here I am researching it to see how I can shut it down. I'm sorry if my servants attacked you, but I placed them around for my own protection. Does this satisfy you?}{[His eyes narrow in displeasure.] You're treading on thin ice stranger. But for the last time, I'll concede to answer you. No, I did not open the portal. I found out about it, and here I am researching it to see how I can shut it down. I'm sorry if my servants attacked you, but I placed them around for my own protection. Does this satisfy you?}{}{}{}{}
