{66}{[He pauses, considering something, and then a malicious grin slowly begins to spread across his face.] I see I cannot fool you stranger. No matter! You're absolutely right! HA! Do you know what trouble I went through to get this pathetic little settlement started? I needed those lives, and the wildlife around here to open up the most wonderous Hellgate in the history of Arcanum! And I will not allow a simpering young fool like you to destroy my plans! }{[He pauses, considering something, and then a malicious grin slowly begins to spread across his face.] I see I cannot fool you stranger. No matter! You're absolutely right! HA! Do you know what trouble I went through to get this pathetic little settlement started? I needed those lives, and the wildlife around here to open up the most wonderous Hellgate in the history of Arcanum! And I will not allow a simpering young fool like you to destroy my plans! }{}{}{}{}
